t field shows it last changed in commit 1e5bad2b on 2026-08-03, eleven days before the 22:54:18Z outage. This supersedes the earlier revision-79fe1d09 records, whose scope notes left the deployed revision unverified.","source_name":"Pinned tenant-infra checkout"}},{"id":"rec_episode_run_515485fe36de4a47a3a6ba463accacd5_12","tool":"emisar","source_type":"emisar","observed_at":"2026-08-15T00:00:41Z","sanitized":true,"output":{"claim":"The signing server upstream stayed reachable throughout, so the monitor name points at the wrong system.","confidence":"high","freshness":"live","observation":"TCP connect to sign.tenant-server.com.br:9810 (192.48.83.203) succeeded at 23:42:42Z and again at 23:43:56Z. The Better Stack Signing Server monitor checks utils.iesdev.com/status/signing, a proxy route on fe-utils, and muellsammler's serveSigningServerStatus returns HTTP 200 with an error body on every failure path, so that route cannot emit 502 from the application itself.","source_name":"TCP reachability probe of the signing server"}},{"id":"rec_episode_run_515485fe36de4a47a3a6ba463accacd5_13","tool":"monitoring","source_type":"monitoring","observed_at":"2026-08-15T00:00:41Z","sanitized":true,"output":{"claim":"The Internal Utils condition cleared, though the Utils monitors flapped repeatedly through the window.","confidence":"high","freshness":"live","observation":"Better Stack resolved Internal Utils 1001636901 after 2 minutes, then 1001638355 after 9 minutes at 23:15:27Z, and resolved Signing Server 1001636832 after 8 minutes and 1001638791 after 24 minutes. Each monitor reopened once between resolutions rather than staying clear.","source_name":"Better Stack Utils monitor lifecycle"}},{"id":"rec_episode_run_515485fe36de4a47a3a6ba463accacd5_14","tool":"emisar","source_type":"emisar","observed_at":"2026-08-15T00:00:41Z","sanitized":true,"output":{"claim":"The 502s came from the VA1 origin itself, not from BunnyCDN.","confidence":"high","freshness":"live","observation":"At 23:42:02Z the CDN returned cdn-requestpullcode: 502 with cdn-requestpullsuccess: True, and a direct probe to frontend-utilities.va1.iesdev.com (192.48.83.250) returned a bare 502 with content-length 11 and no x-response-time header, which healthy application responses do carry. /static/json/app/ota served 200 as a CDN cache HIT throughout.","source_name":"BunnyCDN and direct origin response headers"}},{"id":"rec_episode_run_515485fe36de4a47a3a6ba463accacd5_15","tool":"emisar","source_type":"emisar","observed_at":"2026-08-15T00:00:41Z","sanitized":true,"output":{"claim":"The Internal Utils endpoint answers again, but through an unstable single origin.","confidence":"high","freshness":"live","observation":"Direct origin sampling of frontend-utilities.va1.iesdev.com every 5s from 23:47:44Z to 23:51:37Z showed /__internal__ returning HTTP 200 in some samples and 502 in others rather than a steady state, so the endpoint recovered without becoming stable.","source_name":"Direct origin HTTP sampling of frontend-utilities.va1.iesdev.com"}},{"id":"rec_episode_run_515485fe36de4a47a3a6ba463accacd5_16","tool":"monitoring","source_type":"monitoring","observed_at":"2026-08-14T23:03:22Z","sanitized":true,"output":{"claim":"Internal Utils is flapping rather than remaining recovered.","confidence":"high","freshness":"live under two minutes","observation":"Better Stack opened a new Internal Utils incident roughly two minutes after the previous incident resolved, reporting HTTP 502 from /__internal__.","source_name":"Better Stack Internal Utils monitor"}},{"id":"rec_episode_run_515485fe36de4a47a3a6ba463accacd5_17","tool":"emisar","source_type":"emisar","observed_at":"2026-08-14T23:04:43Z","sanitized":true,"output":{"claim":"Frontend Utilities dynamic endpoints are currently unavailable while static delivery works.","confidence":"high","freshness":"live under one minute","observation":"At 23:04:42–23:04:43 UTC, /__internal__ and /status/signing returned HTTP 502; /static/json/app/ota retu