ins b116bd2, which began emitting EmptyDataError whenever a successful response contains an empty data array and emitting NetworkError for non-OK responses. Newer commits through 6b4a375 do not remove that behavior.","source_name":"Pinned tenant-app-svelte checkout"}},{"id":"rec_episode_run_515485fe36de4a47a3a6ba463accacd5_37","tool":"emisar","source_type":"emisar","observed_at":"2026-08-14T17:20:35Z","sanitized":true,"output":{"claim":"Grafana currently has no firing alerts.","confidence":"high","freshness":"live","observation":"Grafana Alertmanager returned an empty firing-alert list.","source_name":"Emisar Grafana alert-state query"}},{"id":"rec_episode_run_515485fe36de4a47a3a6ba463accacd5_38","tool":"emisar","source_type":"emisar","observed_at":"2026-08-14T17:20:57Z","sanitized":true,"output":{"claim":"Recent service evidence shows ongoing reduced capability for the affected match.","confidence":"high","freshness":"live 10-minute window","observation":"VictoriaLogs recorded three HTTP 500 responses for /lol/match/PBE1_4532326618 at 17:12:53–17:12:56 UTC, followed by a fresh probe reproducing the same failure.","source_name":"Emisar VictoriaLogs query"}},{"id":"rec_episode_run_515485fe36de4a47a3a6ba463accacd5_39","tool":"emisar","source_type":"emisar","observed_at":"2026-08-14T17:21:07Z","sanitized":true,"output":{"claim":"A representative LoL match lookup currently fails.","confidence":"high","freshness":"live","observation":"The exact recently failing request https://lol.v2.iesdev.com/lol/match/PBE1_4532326618 returned HTTP 500 in 236 ms with a 12-byte response.","source_name":"Emisar HTTP probe"}},{"id":"rec_episode_run_515485fe36de4a47a3a6ba463accacd5_40","tool":"repository","source_type":"repository","observed_at":"2026-08-14T17:21:15Z","sanitized":true,"output":{"claim":"The current failure follows recent changes to LoL match fetching.","confidence":"high","freshness":"current pinned revision","observation":"Pinned tenant-backend-rs revision adb9efaf includes commit 867b149, which routes every Riot call through Pyke; the endpoint still propagates fetch_match errors through AppError while documenting only 200, 403, and 404 outcomes.","source_name":"Pinned tenant-backend-rs checkout"}},{"id":"rec_episode_run_515485fe36de4a47a3a6ba463accacd5_41","tool":"monitoring","source_type":"monitoring","observed_at":"2026-08-14T04:46:55Z","sanitized":true,"output":{"claim":"The monitor reports historical Starfall errors but does not provide evidence sufficient to validate their magnitude or cause.","confidence":"high","freshness":"historical three-hour window ending 47 minutes before investigation","observation":"BetterStack reports 637,882 EMPTY_ERROR_TYPE events from 01:00–04:00 UTC, but supplies neither a fingerprint nor a top error message or affected-user count.","source_name":"BetterStack App_svelte alert"}},{"id":"rec_episode_run_515485fe36de4a47a3a6ba463accacd5_42","tool":"emisar","source_type":"emisar","observed_at":"2026-08-14T04:47:44Z","sanitized":true,"output":{"claim":"Current indicators show no continuing Starfall in-game error activity.","confidence":"high","freshness":"live 15-minute window","observation":"VictoriaLogs returned no hits for starfall/in-game or starfallin-game in the latest 15 minutes.","source_name":"Emisar VictoriaLogs hit query"}},{"id":"rec_episode_run_515485fe36de4a47a3a6ba463accacd5_43","tool":"emisar","source_type":"emisar","observed_at":"2026-08-14T04:47:43Z","sanitized":true,"output":{"claim":"The representative Starfall in-game route currently responds successfully.","confidence":"high","freshness":"live, under one minute","observation":"https://tenant.example/starfall/in-game returned HTTP 200 in 150 ms with 52,659 bytes.","source_name":"Emisar HTTP probe"}},{"id":"rec_episode_run_515485fe36de4a47a3a6ba463accacd5_44","tool":"repository","source_type":"repository","observed_at":"2026-08-14T04:47:13Z","sanitized":true,"output":{"claim":"The current frontend revision did not change the Starfa